      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STRUGGLE STREET (7) talented mare who was on the wrong part of the track with a fading fifth over 1200m at Wagga on the heavy (10) track. Assess on her dominant win two back at Moe. Will take catching. MASTER OF DISGUISE (3) improver third up after she went out hard before finishing sixth over 1200m at Wyong in a decent race. Gets in light with the claim and has genuine prospects. ZETHUS (2) tough old gelding kept fresh for this. Went back from the wide gate and failed to get into the contest when twelfth over 1200m at Seymour on August 7. Since fitted with a trial placing over 900m at Wangaratta. Improver. PRETTY PENGUIN (6) seven-year-old mare who may have needed the run last start when resuming at Bendigo over 1000m. In the mix on best.",
